---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`Privacy Policy - ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Privacy Policy and data governance standards." />
		<style>
			main {
				width: 820px;
				max-width: calc(100% - 2em);
				margin: auto;
				padding: 3em 1em;
				color: #334155;
				line-height: 1.7;
			}
			h1 { color: #0f172a; font-size: 2.2em; margin-bottom: 0.3em; }
			h2 { color: #0f172a; font-size: 1.4em; margin-top: 1.8em; }
			p { margin-bottom: 1.2em; }
			ul { margin-bottom: 1.2em; padding-left: 1.5em; }
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
			<p><em>Last updated: September 2026</em></p>

			<p>At <strong>Conflict Report</strong> (accessible from https://confreport.com), one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors. This Privacy Policy document outlines the types of information recorded and how we utilize it.</p>

			<h2>Information We Collect</h2>
			<p>Like most standard websites, Conflict Report collects non-personally-identifying information of the sort that web browsers and servers typically make available, such as browser type, language preference, referring site, and the date and time of each visitor request.</p>

			<h2>Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
			<p>Conflict Report uses standard cookies to store information about visitors' preferences, optimize the user experience, and customize web page content based on visitors' browser types or device parameters.</p>

			<h2>Third-Party Advertising & Analytics</h2>
			<p>Third-party vendors, including Google, may use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to our website or other websites on the internet. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to users based on their visits to Conflict Report and other sites.</p>
			<p>Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>.</p>

			<h2>Contact Us</h2>
			<p>If you have additional questions or require more information about our Privacy Policy, do not hesitate to contact us at <strong>contact@confreport.com</strong>.</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
